      "content": "PICCOTT'S END 1. 5252                                                   (East Side)                                                   Nos 142 to 148 (even) TL 0509 8/210 II                       GV 2. C18 altered C19.  Red brick, hipped old tiled roof.  2 storeys and attics, 5 flush casement windows with glazing bars.  Ground floor cambered arches, single storey 2 window central projection under Welsh slated roof.  Included for group value. Nos 140 to 150 (even) form a group. Listing NGR: TL0508609144"
    }
